# Motion+ (paid Motion components, e.g. AnimateNumber) installs from its own
# registry. Safe to commit: the token is read from the MOTION_TOKEN
# environment variable, never written here. Locally it lives in
# apps/web/.env.local; CI exposes the MOTION_TOKEN secret to npm ci.
@motionplus:registry=https://api.motion.dev/npm/
//api.motion.dev/npm/:_authToken=${MOTION_TOKEN}
